<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Hi there,&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Thank you for choosing The Lactation Network! We are reaching out with an additional step needed to grant you coverage through the VA CCN.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
<br />
For us to move forward with offering lactation services to you, we require an active Community Care Referral covering Lactation Care Services.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
We need your local VA Community Care Department to add The Lactation Network to your Maternity Care referral or Lactation Care referral. We require this to be sent electronically through the HealthShare Referral Manager system (HSRM).<br />
<br />
The Lactation Network is an approved VA Community Care Network provider through Optum &amp; can be found using the group NPI 1144749391. You can reach out to your local VA Community Care department and VA Maternity Care Coordinator for assistance with this request. Please feel free to pass along this email if your local care department requires any assistance from us.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
